{"data": [{"author_id": "255657885", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:27:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117760657399701738"], "id": "2117760657399701738", "in_reply_to_user_id": "255657885", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117760360489029655", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "I even have scheduled tasks and my dot constantly checking to unblock and nudge stalled chats. Still does not work. I cannot be the only one experiencing this. Idk how it doesn\u2019t drive other people insane", "url": "https://x.com/Seedy/status/2117760657399701738"}, {"author_id": "1081064429737848832", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:27:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117760576843862042"], "id": "2117760576843862042", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117746467058405665", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux bad news\uff0cWhy does my Dot no longer have access to a desktop environment for GUI interactions? It used to have one before, but now it's gone. Why was this capability removed or disabled?", "url": "https://x.com/jsdfhasuh/status/2117760576843862042"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117758794675470336"]}, "author_id": "701165828", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:20:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117758877227753509"], "id": "2117758877227753509", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4398626122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@OpenAI @Thsottiaux Love my DOT AI buddy, but any chance we could get a little more control over what it accesses in the background?\n\nIf I ask it not to read something unless I explicitly request it, that preference should be enforced before any data is accessed. Task-specific https://t.co/duS1oGQE2I", "url": "https://x.com/RsThrive/status/2117758877227753509"}, {"author_id": "2071348070760013824", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754949660443058"], "id": "2117754949660443058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT Dots won't stay unlimited forever, and I'm already dreading it.\n\n50+ hours in two weeks and I use it for literally everything. When the limits land, what's your backup plan?\n\nDuet? Grok Bot?\n\nBack to the terminal?", "url": "https://x.com/nvandewetering/status/2117754949660443058"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117753449324433408"]}, "author_id": "1280587925336530948", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:01:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754120614596741"], "id": "2117754120614596741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 988, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117727563749401013", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "BREAKING $AMD Q3 2026 Earning Call Full\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\n\n~Q3 is most profitable quarter @AMD hit\n~We are gaining shares\n~ Agentic is now growing significantly (CPU)\n~ Turin is the most widely deployed in public cloud(2 years old CPU and still going strong)\n~ $META @Muse @OpenAI Dots are https://t.co/CrD7LdcuZf https://t.co/gtPBNzpHj0", "url": "https://x.com/MikeLongTerm/status/2117754120614596741"}, {"author_id": "1438892745049968644", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:57:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117753120398664159"], "id": "2117753120398664159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Whoever decides road closures in my DOT region is a moron.", "url": "https://x.com/TheDurhamReport/status/2117753120398664159"}, {"author_id": "15088020", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:56:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117752865540166031"], "id": "2117752865540166031", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117746467058405665", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I've built a bunch of tools to make my dot much more useful as a director without having to route everything through cloud chats just to route to local chats for execution... my dot is a frog.. my frog is very happy right now :)", "url": "https://x.com/otlg30/status/2117752865540166031"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117750751443263489"]}, "author_id": "1965180325619007490", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:48:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117750839549054987"], "id": "2117750839549054987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "new icon as i enter my dot era https://t.co/VehKYskSIS", "url": "https://x.com/alkrosviir/status/2117750839549054987"}, {"author_id": "1327668093561286656", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:38:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117748267794518303"], "id": "2117748267794518303", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 372, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117746467058405665", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I fired my dot today because it keeps getting worse. The free Muse is now my codex coordinator as of today", "url": "https://x.com/Bananasaur_Rex/status/2117748267794518303"}, {"author_id": "2619637516", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:35:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117747647465292137"], "id": "2117747647465292137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 281, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Africa always playing catch up in most technological advancement, just called my Dot and how the naturally spoking voice is just surreal compared to us still struggling with Text-to-Speech for our locally languages\n\nCan we really win or it will always be playing catch up at", "url": "https://x.com/Dominus_Kelvin/status/2117747647465292137"}, {"author_id": "2098351080308400128", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:30:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117746236459741585"], "id": "2117746236459741585", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GPT is retarded, right now. I can only assume this is from a model roll-out. Infuriatingly retarded, my Dot has become.", "url": "https://x.com/breakingbabel/status/2117746236459741585"}, {"author_id": "1846213442656784384", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:27:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117745590541119743"], "id": "2117745590541119743", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey guys I figured out why OpenAI dots aren\u2019t great and why Grok @bot is amazing. \n\nIt is the model it was always the model lol. \n\nAstra/Terra don\u2019t even remotely come close to Opus. \n\nA task my dot struggled with for 3 hours literally opus one shotted in about 13 minutes", "url": "https://x.com/taylorhbuilds/status/2117745590541119743"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117744508125548544"]}, "author_id": "2097537046839738369", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:23:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117744512076587403"], "id": "2117744512076587403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Slopped this title menu image together. Only took like an hour or two. Most of the time was making sure each image was correct. 3 fingers 1 thumb. Three toes. I probably should have done the layering myself but my Dot did it all for me as I spoke it into existence. https://t.co/iPH8yYhSHJ", "url": "https://x.com/SlopMachinez/status/2117744512076587403"}, {"author_id": "2026083219636908032", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:17:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117743067746714042"], "id": "2117743067746714042", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot vs ChatGPT Dots \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udd25\n\nWhich AI assistant is actually BETTER?!\n\nI wanna hear from people who\u2019ve tried both. Is one really ahead of the other, or is it all hype? \ud83e\udd16\n\nTeam Grok or Team ChatGPT? \ud83d\udc47", "url": "https://x.com/CKEVS1998/status/2117743067746714042"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117735710149267457"]}, "author_id": "91967158", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:49:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117735830966124942"], "id": "2117735830966124942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I\u2019m putting together an AI team: Every, Claude, Gemini, Grok and my Dot. The idea is to bring different perspectives to the table and make the work better.\n\nToday, while reviewing a post in Slack, Grok proposed starting a group DM with the other agents. My Dot stepped in to keep https://t.co/9nEqogDW6P", "url": "https://x.com/NubianCode/status/2117735830966124942"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117733174172176384"]}, "author_id": "837215679069700096", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:38:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117733180320972946"], "id": "2117733180320972946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114789222389297649", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Follow-up to my analysis of The @X Subscription, based on 40,618 @grok @bot usage records (Oct 13 \u2013 Nov 3, 2026).\n\nGrok Bot (@spacexai):\n\u2022 Premium: \u20ac30/mo \u2192 ~1.97B tokens/mo (\u20ac0.0158/1M)\n\u2022 Super: \u20ac100/mo \u2192 ~7.35B tokens/mo (\u20ac0.0139/1M)\n\nBoth include a persistent cloud https://t.co/87489lmIO9 https://t.co/aJlD6LKSEU", "url": "https://x.com/Rhiz3K/status/2117733180320972946"}, {"author_id": "1846969791304908800", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:35:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117732516211703843"], "id": "2117732516211703843", "in_reply_to_user_id": "830171539999952896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117693544496295951", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@darekgusto I kinda want it... I'm doing something similar with my dot now!", "url": "https://x.com/SmithStation1/status/2117732516211703843"}, {"author_id": "312402206", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:31:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117731357954908474"], "id": "2117731357954908474", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1401443653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117629253176922611", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@amix3k Loving this. First job for my Dot this morning, and first automation now set up!", "url": "https://x.com/dominicbressan/status/2117731357954908474"}, {"author_id": "35828468", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:30:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117731207559397590"], "id": "2117731207559397590", "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117728244703412487", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alexandr_wang If OpenAI Dots don't add this in 2 days, I'm switching.", "url": "https://x.com/NAM37/status/2117731207559397590"}, {"author_id": "79511003", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:09:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117725968391639315"], "id": "2117725968391639315", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1369348853414178822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117719430042202311", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AlexFinn In 2027 it will be Gemini Bot still unknown! Claude Duet, OpenAI Dots,  \ud83c\udd9a Grok bot let the fight begin! Haha \ud83e\udd23", "url": "https://x.com/moubuntu/status/2117725968391639315"}, {"author_id": "86594943", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117720222316773825"], "id": "2117720222316773825", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14901258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117718629441757595", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@btraut By archiving does that retain conversation memorization vs deleting them? Some chats I didn\u2019t open a temporary tab so I have to delete one by one. My dot opens a lot of codex conversations as well.", "url": "https://x.com/wolfofdena/status/2117720222316773825"}, {"author_id": "1144666675809177600", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:38:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117718051630272557"], "id": "2117718051630272557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 221, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "They gotta take terra out of my dot, it just sent an email as me without me asking wtf", "url": "https://x.co